  319
  320 ## 5. Dapr 服务调用关系总览
  321
  322 ```
  323 前端
  324   ↓
  325 eiker-company-service (business·Go)
  326   ├─ invoke → eiker-company-es       搜索/查询
  327   ├─ invoke → eiker-company-db       申诉/主张写入
  328   ├─ invoke → eiker-ocr-paddleocr    OCR（主）
  329   ├─ invoke → eiker-ocr-easyocr      OCR（备）
  330   └─ invoke → eiker-third-tianyancha 天眼查验实
  331
  332 eiker-company-update (business·Go)
  333   ├─ invoke → eiker-company-db       任务单管理、事实数据写入
  334   ├─ invoke → eiker-ocr-paddleocr / eiker-ocr-easyocr
  335   ├─ invoke → eiker-third-tianyancha
  336   ├─ invoke → eiker-file-excelize / eiker-file-pandas  文件解析
  337   └─ invoke → eiker-location-update  触发位置预置
  338
  339 eiker-location-update (business·Go)
  340   ├─ invoke → eiker-location-db
  341   └─ invoke → eiker-third-tencent    腾讯地图三类API
  342
  343 eiker-company-db (atomic·Go)
  344   └─ pub/sub publish → topic: company-fact-upserted
  345
  346 eiker-company-es (atomic·Go)
  347   └─ pub/sub subscribe ← topic: company-fact-upserted
  348 ```
  349
